<h1>mkbrr Unofficial Community RPM Repository</h1>
<p><strong>{mode}Independent third-party repository. Not maintained or endorsed by the autobrr team.</strong>
Official upstream RPMs are verified against upstream checksums, then independently signed.
You are trusting this repository's signing key, not an upstream signing key.</p>
<p>Repository: <a href="https://github.com/{repository}">{repository}</a> ·
<a href="https://github.com/autobrr/mkbrr">Upstream</a> ·
<a href="mkbrr-community.repo">Download .repo file</a> ·
<a href="provenance.json">Provenance and original checksums</a> (<a href="provenance.json.asc">signature</a>)</p>
<h2>Verify the key first</h2>
<p>Compare this full fingerprint with the independently obtained fingerprint in the maintainer's
GitHub repository variable/documentation or another trusted channel. This page alone is not independent verification.</p>
<pre>{fingerprint}</pre>
<pre>curl --fail --location --proto '=https' --proto-redir '=https' '{base_url}/RPM-GPG-KEY-mkbrr-community' -o /tmp/mkbrr-community.asc
gpg --show-keys --with-fingerprint /tmp/mkbrr-community.asc
# Only after independently comparing the full fingerprint:
sudo rpmkeys --import /tmp/mkbrr-community.asc
sudo dnf config-manager addrepo --from-repofile='{base_url}/mkbrr-community.repo'
sudo dnf install mkbrr
sudo dnf upgrade mkbrr</pre>
<p>DNF4: use <code>sudo dnf config-manager --add-repo '{base_url}/mkbrr-community.repo'</code>.
Portable alternative: download the .repo file to <code>/etc/yum.repos.d/mkbrr-community.repo</code> with sudo curl.
Do not bypass package or metadata signature checks.</p>
<h2>Published versions and corresponding source</h2>
<p>The repository includes every upstream RPM architecture. DNF selects compatible packages.
ARMv6 packages are not a promise of ARMv7/Fedora ARM compatibility.</p>
{releases}
<p>Matching source archives, upstream build scripts, GPL license, and Go dependency source archives
are served here alongside binaries. See <a href="sources/README.txt">source instructions</a>.
No mkbrr source is rebuilt or changed by this repository.</p>
<h2>Remove the repository</h2>
<pre>sudo rm /etc/yum.repos.d/mkbrr-community.repo
sudo dnf clean all
# Optional: sudo dnf remove mkbrr</pre>
<p>For supported systems, key rotation, troubleshooting, and maintainer setup, see the
<a href="https://github.com/{repository}#readme">README</a>.</p>
